AI is reshaping how startups are being built. Founders who've never written a line of code
before are shipping production applications, reaching revenue before scaling headcount, and
building tools to automate their most tedious workflows. The founder's role is shifting from
individual contributor to orchestrator, allowing them to focus on the work only they can do.

